  Question(
    questionText: 'A security policy mandates that all data access to an Azure Storage account must authenticate exclusively via Microsoft Entra ID (Azure RBAC), completely prohibiting access via Storage Account Access Keys and Shared Access Signatures (SAS). Which setting should the administrator configure?',
