  Question(
    questionText: 'A data engineering team needs an Azure Storage account optimized for big data analytics frameworks (such as Apache Spark and Azure Synapse), requiring high-performance directory renames, folder-level access control lists (POSIX ACLs), and atomic operations. Which feature must be enabled when creating the storage account?',
